      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As of the latest release [1470] the controllers are now aligned correctly and the avatar hands appear to be in the correct place compared to PCVR.\n\nThe only remaining issue is that the laser pointers start a bit too far outward compared to PCVR, causing them to \"go through\" the quick menu when it's held within about 10cm of the end of the controller.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
